"P3515852299" "This Dr. Sebastian Rossi may be a long shot. Heck, he may be a basket case. But he's the only chance I've got at reclaiming my powers. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to go to the sewers and see if you can extract Rossi from among the Lost.</A> And if he doesn't want to come, tough cookies."
