// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1370912111" "Dr. Sebastian Rossi may not be able to restore my original powers, but if his pungent friends among the Lost are to be believed, he may be able to induce new ones. Trouble is, he's in the hands of Dr. Aeon. I think someone had better pry those hands apart. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want Rossi, {VillainName}, and I want him now.</A> Do your stuff."
// AcceptString :
"P535529896" "Get Dr. Rossi"
// SendOffString :
"P1344934936" "It seems like eons ago that I could summon the shadows to do my bidding. Help me become as powerful as I was then, and you will have a friend for life."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3298178254" "Free Dr. Rossi"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2404784473" "I want Rossi, and anything he's produced while working for Aeon. Get it?"

